        <body>
            <div xml:id="d939">

                <pb facs="0647" n="575" xml:id="pg575"/>

                <head>Grutli Union of Geneva</head>
                <note rend="inline" rendition="#center" type="source">[Translation.]</note>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grutli Society of Geneva</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1865-05-13">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 13, 1865</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">To the Bund, in Berne:</hi>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Editor</hi>: I respectfully request you, by
                    these few lines, to hand the enclosed paper to the central address committee in
                    Berne.</p>
                <p>Accept my thanks for the invitation to join in the expression of sympathy for our
                    sister republic beyond the ocean, and believe me your humble and obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C. ROTH, </signed>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President</hi>.</closer>


                <xi:include href="d939-a1.xml" xpointer="d939-a1"/>
            </div>
